<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <fullName>Answer_Type__c</fullName>
    <description
    >What this answer IS, decided by the PUBLISHED question - never by the shape of the JSON that arrived, so the same question always stores the same way whether the payload carried 42 or "42". Restricted so a future code path cannot invent "Bool" and split every report. Which column holds the value: Text/Email/Phone/URL/Choice -&gt; Text_Value__c; Options -&gt; Selected_Options_JSON__c; Number -&gt; Numeric_Value__c; Boolean -&gt; Boolean_Value__c; Date -&gt; Date_Value__c; DateTime -&gt; DateTime_Value__c. A row whose declared column is empty while Value_Unparsed__c is true means the answer did not convert and the raw text was kept (FREEFORM_SPEC 5.2.1).</description>
    <inlineHelpText
    >What the answer is. Tells you which value field holds it - and means a ticked Boolean Value only counts when this says Boolean.</inlineHelpText>
